chapter.v:
Little children, 


let no, 


one deceive you. Whoever practices righteousness is righteous, as he is righteous.

Little children, 


let us, 


not love in word or talk but in deed and in truth.

By this 


we shall, 


know that we are of the truth and reassure our heart before him;

Beloved, if 


our heart, 


does not condemn us, we have confidence before God;
